  partName: Right Center Exhaust Manifold Bolt
  description: The Right Center Exhaust Manifold Bolt is a small, elongated bolt
    located at the top-right-center of the engine, constructed from Material.001,
    which fastens the exhaust manifold to the engine block, enabling efficient exhaust
    gas flow. This bolt is crucial for maintaining engine performance and reducing
    emissions. Notably, its central location allows for balanced exhaust gas distribution.
